    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656980/extras/c67ace9247b0fa5a33fd24cdbfd7d1d9.poster.avif?t=1750241087\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656980/extras/c67ace9247b0fa5a33fd24cdbfd7d1d9.webm?t=1750241087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656980/extras/c67ace9247b0fa5a33fd24cdbfd7d1d9.mp4?t=1750241087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corgi Conquest is a difficult platformer</strong> where you're a corgi trying to get back to your owner! Continue to dash your way out of heaven all while trying not to fall back to hell... Learn from every fall then learn to climb back faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 9 individual levels to master and a<strong> New Game Plus</strong>\u00a0for when you master the main tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656980/extras/6ff28d9ef58c1a2ed704b37e134b41f7.poster.avif?t=1750241087\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656980/extras/6ff28d9ef58c1a2ed704b37e134b41f7.webm?t=1750241087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656980/extras/6ff28d9ef58c1a2ed704b37e134b41f7.mp4?t=1750241087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash with the mouse</strong> and click quickly and precisely to reach the top and get back to to your owner. With the<strong> Arrows,</strong> or<strong>\u00a0AD</strong> increase your momentum to dash with just enough distance to reach the next platform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you get the corgi back to it's owner...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656980/extras/c67ace9247b0fa5a33fd24cdbfd7d1d9.poster.avif?t=1750241087\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656980/extras/c67ace9247b0fa5a33fd24cdbfd7d1d9.webm?t=1750241087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656980/extras/c67ace9247b0fa5a33fd24cdbfd7d1d9.mp4?t=1750241087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corgi Conquest is a difficult platformer</strong> where you're a corgi trying to get back to your owner! Continue to dash your way out of heaven all while trying not to fall back to hell... Learn from every fall then learn to climb back faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 9 individual levels to master and a<strong> New Game Plus</strong>\u00a0for when you master the main tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656980/extras/6ff28d9ef58c1a2ed704b37e134b41f7.poster.avif?t=1750241087\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656980/extras/6ff28d9ef58c1a2ed704b37e134b41f7.webm?t=1750241087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656980/extras/6ff28d9ef58c1a2ed704b37e134b41f7.mp4?t=1750241087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash with the mouse</strong> and click quickly and precisely to reach the top and get back to to your owner. With the<strong> Arrows,</strong> or<strong>\u00a0AD</strong> increase your momentum to dash with just enough distance to reach the next platform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you get the corgi back to it's owner...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
